CORE
test.c
--sarif-result - --json-ui
^EXIT=1$
^SIGNAL=0$
cannot be combined with another
--
"\$schema"
--
Checks that --sarif-result - is rejected with a usage error when combined with
a stdout-based UI mode (here --json-ui), rather than interleaving SARIF and
JSON into invalid output. No SARIF document is produced.
